{
  "notes": [
    "Every sound event of the game. A real recording goes in audio-src/<id>/ (see scripts/audio.mjs); until there is one, the game plays the synthesized placeholder described by `synth`.",
    "bus: sfx | ambience. priority 1..10: when too many voices play, the lowest priority is dropped first. voices: most of this sound playing at once. gap: least seconds between two plays. pitch: random speed variation (+-). lufs: loudness the file is normalized to by the script, at gain 1: this is the mix (the gun is the reference, screams sit well under it). gain: a further trim on top, without redoing the files.",
    "synth: dur seconds, layers summed and peak-normalized. layer: type noise|sine|saw|square; f0 f1 (Hz sweep over the sound); lp 0..1 / hp 0..1 one-pole filter (noise); decay (s, 0 = none); attack (s); period (s, repeating pulses); vibrato (Hz); delay (s); amp."
  ],
